# Vercel upload manifest. Vercel uses THIS file (not .gitignore) when present, so the live site
# ships docs/ + CHANGELOG.md (the /docs and /changelog routes read them at build/runtime) even
# though .gitignore intentionally hides all *.md from the public GitHub repo.
#
# Deploy from local with `vercel --prod` so these files are included in the upload.
# Only build artifacts, dependencies, and secrets are excluded below.

.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
out
**/dist
.vercel
.consumer-smoke

# Secrets — never upload; Vercel uses its own dashboard env vars.
.env
.env.local
*.log

# Local data / build outputs / analysis artifacts (regenerated, not needed for the web build).
coverage
**/coverage
artifacts
reports
broadcast
cache
**/cache
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report
test-results

# Internal, non-English analysis notes — kept locally but never served on the public /docs site.
docs/mantle-turing-test-product-analysis.md
